aría bueno tambien que tuviera workshop", "timestamp_created": 1773799617, "timestamp_updated": 1773799617, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.59706956148147583", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220801093", "author": {"steamid": "76561198769360447", "personaname": "Alanbrito", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198769360447/", "num_games_owned": 59, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1236, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 173, "last_played": 1783433929, "avatar": "554f61676c240f0263ff832d7905b0d5507308f1"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Aunque todos lo odian a mi me llega a entretener mas que left 4 dead, tiene buenos graficos y una jugabilidad buena aunque el sistema de cartas puede llegar a ser dificil de entender.\n", "timestamp_created": 1773637493, "timestamp_updated": 1773637493, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220147364", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353891334", "personaname": "Jasc", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198353891334/", "num_games_owned": 207, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 728, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 586, "last_played": 1780562905, "avatar": "26eb6e454ff21cbd336fd19c46388bbf6a9077a6"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Si", "timestamp_created": 1772941846, "timestamp_updated": 1772941846, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vo